20:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","p","Spotify is licensed music and po",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Spotify is licensed music and podcast streaming: you do not buy songs one by one, you rent access to an enormous catalogue while you subscribe, or while you use the free tier supported by ads. In Indonesia it is the main door to listening legally."}],["$","p","Precisely because Premium costs ",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Precisely because Premium costs money, searches for Spotify mods and free premium are extremely common - and extremely risky. This page explains the official differences honestly, plus the features, permissions, and how to listen without wasting data. The button here goes only to Play Store."}]]}]
21:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":["What ","Spotify"," Does"]}],[["$","p","On a phone, the free tier has re",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"On a phone, the free tier has real limits: audio ads, shuffle play on many playlists, limited skips, and standard audio quality. Premium removes the ads, unlocks free song choice and unlimited skips, raises quality, and adds downloads so music plays offline inside the app. Official plan prices are always the ones shown in the app - and beware bargain Premium accounts from random sellers: they are usually stolen accounts that can die at any moment, taking yours with them."}],["$","p","A Spotify mod is the official ap",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"A Spotify mod is the official app altered by a third party so paid features open without paying. Beyond violating the terms and the licences that pay musicians, accounts caught using mods can be restricted or closed, and mod files are a favourite malware carrier. The genuinely legal free options have limits, and that is normal: the official free tier, an official trial when offered, or the student plan if you qualify. Spotify is also Indonesia's biggest podcast home, from comedy and horror to education and daily news."}]]]}]
22:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Safety & Privacy"}],[["$","p","The official Spotify app from Pl",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"The official Spotify app from Play Store is safe. The risks live around it: pirated mod files and the market for stolen Premium accounts. Both break the rules, and both put your account at stake - Spotify acts against unofficial clients, so years of playlists can be lost over a shortcut."}],["$","p","Protect the account with a uniqu",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Protect the account with a unique password and a verified email, and be wary of messages promising free Premium that ask you to sign in on a Spotify lookalike site - that is phishing. Always sign in from the official app, or by typing the address yourself."}]]]}]
